[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Continuum has been installed to /usr/local/www/continuum

To configure:
1. Copy the sample configuration:
   cp /usr/local/www/continuum/config/settings.ini.sample /usr/local/www/continuum/config/settings.ini

2. Edit settings.ini: per-agent API keys in [agents], and the storage
   engine endpoints ([valkey], [couchdb], [arcadedb]). Optional bridges:
   [embeddings] (semantic context-pack ranking), [heliofane]
   (promote_to_memory), [milestones] (external tracker adapter).

3. Create the CouchDB databases (prefix from couchdb.database_prefix):
     ${prefix}_plans ${prefix}_tasks ${prefix}_events ${prefix}_boards
   and the ArcadeDB database named by arcadedb.database. The graph schema
   (Task/Agent types and indexes) is created automatically at startup.

4. Configure Apache using the shipped front-stack example (plain :80
   health-check vhost + PROXY protocol v2 vhost for the TLS front stack):
     cp /usr/local/share/examples/continuum/continuum.conf.sample \
        /usr/local/etc/apache24/sites.d/continuum.conf
   service apache24 restart

5. Verify (read-only), with any key from [agents]:
     curl -s -H "X-Api-Key: <agent-key>" http://localhost/health
     curl -s -H "X-Api-Key: <agent-key>" http://localhost/mcp -X POST \
       -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
       -H 'Accept: application/json, text/event-stream' \
       -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"tools/call",\
            "params":{"name":"server_info","arguments":{}}}'

IMPORTANT: Continuum is managed by pkg. Do NOT extract source tarballs
over this installation. Always upgrade with: pkg update && pkg upgrade

Documentation: https://pacyworld.dev/buenapp/continuum
EOM
}
